OL,3,GNEWSAItem that prompted A&E evacuation 
OL,4,Awas e-bike charger                     
OL,6,FPart of an A&E department was evacuated
OL,7,Fafter concerns were raised over a man  
OL,8,Fcarrying a "suspicious item" that was  
OL,9,Ffound to be an e-bike charger.         
OL,11,FPolice said a man was spoken to at the 
OL,12,FLeicester Royal Infirmary at 17:36 GMT 
OL,13,Fon Sunday, following concern he was    
OL,14,Fcarrying a "suspicious device".        
OL,16,FAs a precaution, the force said part of
OL,17,Fthe department was evacuated and closed
OL,18,Ffor a short time. Police added no      
OL,19,Foffences were committed, but arrested a
OL,20,F44-year-old man at the scene on        
OL,21,Fsuspicion of immigration offences.     
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
