OL,3,GNEWSAItem that prompted A&E evacuation 
OL,4,Awas e-bike charger                     
OL,6,FThe NHS trust that runs the hospital   
OL,7,Fsaid - due to the fire risk associated 
OL,8,Fwith lithium batteries - e-bikes,      
OL,9,Fe-scooters and their chargers were not 
OL,10,Fpermitted on its hospital sites.       
